{"beat": 18, "name": "THE GUARANTEE", "text": "There was one more piece of the machine, and it's the one that made strangers buy from a catalogue. Sears printed a guarantee. In the guidebook's version: if for any reason whatever you are dissatisfied with any article purchased from us, we expect you to return it to us at our expense, and we will return your money, including any transportation charges you paid. Notice the last part. The guarantee named shipping by name. That tells you which cost its customers worried about. A small correction to the story you may have heard: Sears didn't invent the money-back guarantee. Montgomery Ward adopted it in 1875. Sears made it part of the machine.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "There", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14}, {"word": "was", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3}, {"word": "one", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.56}, {"word": "more", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.78}, {"word": "piece", "start": 0.78, "end": 1.1}, {"word": "of", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.28}, {"word": "the", "start": 1.28, "end": 1.38}, {"word": "machine,", "start": 1.38, "end": 1.82}, {"word": "and", "start": 2.36, "end": 2.5}, {"word": "it's", "start": 2.5, "end": 2.66}, {"word": "the", "start": 2.66, "end": 2.76}, {"word": "one", "start": 2.76, "end": 2.94}, {"word": "that", "start": 2.94, "end": 3.08}, {"word": "made", "start": 3.08, "end": 3.3}, {"word": "strangers", "start": 3.3, "end": 3.88}, {"word": "buy", "start": 3.88, "end": 4.32}, {"word": "from", "start": 4.32, "end": 4.58}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.58, "end": 4.72}, {"word": "catalogue.", "start": 4.72, "end": 5.12}, {"word": "Sears", "start": 5.92, "end": 6.44}, {"word": "printed", "start": 6.44, "end": 6.84}, {"word": "a", "start": 6.84, "end": 7.02}, {"word": "guarantee.", "start": 7.02, "end": 7.46}, {"word": "In", "start": 8.22, "end": 8.38}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.38, "end": 8.5}, {"word": "guidebook's", "start": 8.5, "end": 9.06}, {"word": "version:", "start": 9.06, "end": 9.48}, {"word": "if"